  "sourceTitle": "Lemon Cookies",
  "sourceText": "Lemon Cookies\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, December 9, 2009 - 12:08am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 box Duncan Hines lemon cake mix smash lumps\n2 eggs, beaten\n1 stick butter, melted\ncooled\n2 heaping c. Rice Krispies\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients together. Drop by teaspoon on greased cookie sheet. Bake at 350 degrees for 10 to 12 minutes.\n\nComments:\nGretchen\n\nwhat about the frosting???",
